00:06:40.640 --> 00:06:46.160
details, this is what we find. And this is nothing&nbsp;
new. We've gone through this routine analyzing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:52.480
Trump's tax plan. Barack Obama's tax plan,&nbsp;
